  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> nên góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> bằng với góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là hình lập phương nên tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác đều.<br>Suy ra góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy góc giữa hai đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b55c18ed699a64c0dca78424ee24a0888c51a09a703be1abc24f0f2b706b345b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
